{
  "id": "01_5275",
  "type": "item",
  "name": {
    "ja": "SD ガンダム クロスシルエット マイティーストライクフリーダムガンダム",
    "en": "SD Gundam Cross Silhouette Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 1980,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2024年09月21日 (土)",
    "year": 2024,
    "month": 9,
    "day": 21
  },
  "targetAge": 8,
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム SEED FREEDOM』に登場の「マイティーストライクフリーダムガンダム」をSDCSで立体化！",
      "en": "\"Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam \" appearing in \" Mobile Suit Gundam SEED FREEDOM\" is made into a three-dimensional SDCS!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• SDCSならではの高頭身(CS)、低頭身(SD)の２種のフレームが付属。ゴールドの成形色で機体の特徴を再現。",
      "en": "• Comes with two types of frames unique to SDCS: high head (CS) and low head and body (SD). Reproduce the characteristics of the aircraft with gold molding color."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部内のパーツを差し替えることで瞳の有無を選択可能。",
      "en": "• You can choose whether or not there are eyes by replacing the parts inside the head."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「プラウドディフェンダー」は飛行状態を再現可能。羽の装甲はスライド可動し展開状態を再現。",
      "en": "• \"Proud Defender\" can reproduce flight conditions. The wing armor can be slid to reproduce the deployed state."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 対艦刀「フツノミタマ」が付属し、ビームサーベルとの２刀流装備状態を再現。",
      "en": "• An anti-ship sword \"Futunomitama\" is included, reproducing the dual-wielding state with a beam saber."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 額部ビーム砲はパーツの開閉で発射状態を再現。",
      "en": "• The forehead beam cannon reproduces the firing state by opening and closing parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腰部レールガンは展開し、一斉射撃状態を再現。",
      "en": "• The waist railgun unfolds and reproduces a simultaneous firing situation."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ビームサーベル、ビームライフルはともに連結ギミックを再現。",
      "en": "• Both the beam saber and beam rifle reproduce the connected gimmick."
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
    {
      "ja": "対艦刀（フツノミタマ）×1",
      "en": "Anti-ship sword (futsunomitama) x 1"
    },
    {
      "ja": "ビームライフル×2",
      "en": "Beam rifle x2"
    },
    {
      "ja": "ビームサーベル×2",
      "en": "Beam saber x2"
    },
    {
